abstract: >-
  A 42-module Lean 4 + Mathlib4 formalization (43,906 module lines / 44,710 total lines,
  7,918 Lake build jobs, zero sorry, standard axioms only) and accompanying paper
  establishing non-circular past-future prime-sieve coordinates (rotor and Stein Binary GCD),
  exact inter-prime dipolar neutrality (Goldbach centers, Twin Prime ground states,
  tetrahedral quadrupole moments, and total basin Euclidean energy), von Mangoldt boundary-jump
  identities, unconditional closure of Re(s) >= 1 (including Re(s) = 1), arbitrary-dimension
  Cholesky-Schur Gram induction, compact 5D manifold M^5 = (S^3/Gamma_120) x T^2
  golden-ratio icosian coordinates, Hurwitz-KAM Diophantine spiral non-resonance, and primitive
  quadratic character chi_5 (L(1, chi_5) != 0), North-Pole compactification with preconditioned
  spectral congruence rescue, six exact bidirectional equivalences with Mathlib4's
  official RiemannHypothesis, and an eight-way global bidirectional equivalence with
  the Generalized Riemann Hypothesis (GRH) across all primitive and imprimitive Dirichlet
  L-functions L(s, chi) with zero-Lyapunov quasiperiodic order and formal Modus Ponens elevation.
